---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="bg-slate-900 text-slate-400 mt-24">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-12">
    <div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-white font-bold text-lg mb-3">
        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <rect width="28" height="28" rx="8" fill="#2563EB"/>
          <path d="M7 8h14M7 12h10M7 16h12M7 20h8" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        </svg>
        InvoiceGen
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">The fastest free online invoice generator. No sign-up. No limits. Create, customize, and download PDF invoices in seconds.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3 class="text-white font-semibold text-sm mb-4 uppercase tracking-wider">Tools</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
        <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Invoice Generator</a></li>
        <li><a href="/free-invoice-generator" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Free Invoice Generator</a></li>
        <li><a href="/online-invoice-generator" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Online Invoice Generator</a></li>
        <li><a href="/invoice-template" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Invoice Templates</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3 class="text-white font-semibold text-sm mb-4 uppercase tracking-wider">Resources</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
        <li><a href="/blog/how-to-create-an-invoice" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">How to Create an Invoice</a></li>
        <li><a href="/blog/invoice-generator-vs-invoicesimple" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">InvoiceGen vs InvoiceSimple</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="border-t border-slate-800">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-6 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs">
      <p>&copy; {year} InvoiceGen. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p>Free invoice generator — no sign-up required.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
